      "text": "the done-when at plan.html:922 asks for \"tests importing the follower's subscription module add no failure against the base on all_debug\" but names no arm log path, no gate command and no EXIT= line, where every sibling section requires each arm's log to sit under the run directory with its revision, literal command and EXIT=",
      "type": "evidence_paths",
      "would_change": true
    },
    {
