      "id": "evidence_paths-2",
      "reason": "the third case's claim (\"the command run against that run succeeds\") is only checkable from a log, and the plan names none.",
      "text": "same absence at plan.html:929: the done-when names a test file and a case list but no arm log, gate command or EXIT= discipline, and this node's third case has to run a real crew command whose record would also need a durable location",
      "type": "evidence_paths",
      "would_change": true
    },
    {
